WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.437
♪ [intro music] ♪

00:00:05.977 --> 00:00:06.920
Give me one minute,

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.866
and I'll show you
how Security Command Center

00:00:08.866 --> 00:00:12.490
can help you secure and manage risks 
for your Google Cloud environment.

00:00:12.792 --> 00:00:16.516
Security Command Center is a native
security and risk management platform

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.584
for Google Cloud

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:20.493
that helps continuously monitor
your Google Cloud environment,

00:00:20.907 --> 00:00:23.004
gain visibility into Cloud assets,

00:00:23.313 --> 00:00:26.081
discover vulnerabilities
and misconfigurations,

00:00:26.081 --> 00:00:27.758
detect and respond to threats,

00:00:27.758 --> 00:00:31.855
and demonstrate compliance space
on industry standards and benchmarks.

00:00:32.311 --> 00:00:33.440
Security Command Center

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:37.513
allows to have centralized visibility
and control over your resources.

00:00:37.954 --> 00:00:39.293
With Security Command Center

00:00:39.293 --> 00:00:42.899
you can easily understand the resources
that are deployed and managed

00:00:43.224 --> 00:00:46.161
and see which resources
have been added or removed.

00:00:46.564 --> 00:00:47.809
Security Command Center

00:00:47.809 --> 00:00:50.874
also allows you to identify
security misconfigurations

00:00:50.874 --> 00:00:53.690
and compliance violations
in your Google Cloud assets,

00:00:54.019 --> 00:00:57.682
and resolve them
by following actionable recommendations.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.048
You can also uncover threats
targeting your resources using logs

00:01:02.048 --> 00:01:05.015
and identify potential compromises
in containers.

00:01:05.738 --> 00:01:08.683
Setting up Security Command Center
is very straightforward.

00:01:08.996 --> 00:01:11.075
Just visit Google Cloud Console,

00:01:11.075 --> 00:01:14.105
and under the <i>Security</i> section
is <i>Security Command Center</i>.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:18.363
The pricing model is simple
and is based on the tier you choose.

00:01:18.363 --> 00:01:20.459
There is a generous free Standard tier

00:01:20.459 --> 00:01:22.657
that you can access through the Console,

00:01:22.657 --> 00:01:24.076
and a paid Premium tier

00:01:24.076 --> 00:01:26.750
that provides enterprise
security capabilities,

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:30.064
which you can access by contacting
the Google Cloud sales team.

00:01:30.674 --> 00:01:33.075
Next time you're looking
to secure and manage risks

00:01:33.075 --> 00:01:34.728
for your Google Cloud environment,

00:01:34.728 --> 00:01:37.215
take a minute to look
at the Security Command Center.

00:01:37.324 --> 00:01:42.135
To learn more, check out
<i>cloud.google.com/security-command-center</i>

00:01:42.714 --> 00:01:45.628
♪ [outro music] ♪

